(API SPECIFICATION DOCUMENT) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(API SPECIFICATION DOCUMENT) Tj T*
(Service: UserAuth API v3.1) Tj T*
(Team: Platform Security Engineering) Tj T*
(Date: June 10, 2024) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(The UserAuth API provides authentication and authorisation services for all internal) Tj T*
(microservices within the Helios Platform. It implements OAuth 2.0 with PKCE and supports) Tj T*
(JWT-based access tokens with a configurable expiry window.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. BASE URL) Tj T*
(Production:  https://auth.helios-platform.internal/v3) Tj T*
(Staging:     https://auth-staging.helios-platform.internal/v3) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. AUTHENTICATION FLOW) Tj T*
(3.1 Authorization Code Flow with PKCE) Tj T*
(  Step 1: Client generates code_verifier and code_challenge \(SHA-256\)) Tj T*
(  Step 2: GET /authorize?response_type=code&client_id=...&code_challenge=...) Tj T*
(  Step 3: User authenticates; server returns authorization_code) Tj T*
(  Step 4: POST /token with code + code_verifier to exchange for access_token) Tj T*
(  Step 5: Access token included as Bearer token in subsequent API requests) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. ENDPOINTS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(POST /token) Tj T*
(  Description: Exchange authorization code for access and refresh tokens) Tj T*
(  Request Body \(application/x-www-form-urlencoded\):) Tj T*
(    grant_type=authorization_code) Tj T*
(    code=<authorization_code>) Tj T*
(    code_verifier=<pkce_verifier>) Tj T*
(    client_id=<client_id>) Tj T*
(  Response 200:) Tj T*
(    { "access_token": "...", "token_type": "Bearer",) Tj T*
(      "expires_in": 3600, "refresh_token": "..." }) Tj T*
(  Response 400: { "error": "invalid_grant" }) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(POST /token/refresh) Tj T*
(  Description: Obtain a new access token using a refresh token) Tj T*
(  Request Body:) Tj T*
(    grant_type=refresh_token) Tj T*
(    refresh_token=<token>) Tj T*
(    client_id=<client_id>) Tj T*
(  Response 200: { "access_token": "...", "expires_in": 3600 }) Tj T*
(  Response 401: { "error": "invalid_token" }) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(POST /token/revoke) Tj T*
(  Description: Revoke an active refresh token) Tj T*
(  Request Body: token=<refresh_token>&client_id=<client_id>) Tj T*
(  Response 200: {} \(empty body on success\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(GET /userinfo) Tj T*
(  Description: Retrieve authenticated user profile) Tj T*
(  Headers: Authorization: Bearer <access_token>) Tj T*
(  Response 200:) Tj T*
(    { "sub": "usr_abc123", "email": "user@example.com",) Tj T*
(      "roles": ["read", "write"], "iat": 1717027200 }) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. ERROR CODES) Tj T*
(  400 invalid_request    ‚Äî Missing or malformed parameters) Tj T*
(  401 invalid_token      ‚Äî Token expired or revoked) Tj T*
(  403 insufficient_scope ‚Äî Token lacks required scope) Tj T*
(  429 rate_limited       ‚Äî Exceeded 100 requests/minute per client) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. RATE LIMITING) Tj T*
(All endpoints are rate-limited to 100 requests per minute per client_id.) Tj T*
(Responses include headers: X-RateLimit-Limit, X-RateLimit-Remaining, X-RateLimit-Reset) Tj T*
ET
endstream
